              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "отплывать (otplyvát) — \"to sail off, to set sail\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Корабль отплывает ровно в полдень. Korábl otplyváyet róvno v pólden. The ship sets sail at exactly noon."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Imperfective; perfective отплыть (отплыву, отплывёшь)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "отплывать (otplyvát) is built from от- 'away' and -плывать, from плыть 'to swim, to sail', which is inherited from Proto-Slavic plyti (EtymDB)."
            }
          ]
        },
