          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "укачивать (ukáchivat) is built from у- and -качивать, from качать 'to rock': to rock someone until they are drowsy or sick. EtymDB does not list the verb."
            }
